    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="16.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 16.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þæt ne mæge, gekyþe ðanne in wiofode mid his gewitena anum oþþe mid cyninges wicgerefan þat he þat feoh undeornunga his cuþan ceape in wic gebohte, ⁊ him man þanne his weorð agefe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he is unable to do that, let him declare then at the altar with one of his witnesses or with the king’s town-reeve that he bought that property without secrecy by his public purchase in the town; and [the] one [who sold it to him] should then give him back the price of it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þæt ne mæge, gekyþe ðanne in wiofode mid his gewitena anum oþþe mid cyninges wicgerefan, þat he þat feoh undeornunga his cuþan ceape in wic gebohte; ⁊ him man þanne his weorð agefe.</ab>
      </div>
